The dipole–target scattering amplitude inferred at NLO accuracy can
be found at https://zenodo.org/records/15552940 and
arXiv:2506.00487.

This folder contains one data file from that set (in particular, the
MAP parametrization obtained using the Balitsky + smallest dipole
running coupling prescription).

The other data files can be downloaded from the Zenodo repository
referenced above.
